msgid "# Sequence Parallelism"
msgstr "# 序列并行"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"Sequence Parallelism (SP) shards the token dimension across tensor-parallel\n"
"ranks around the communication boundaries of transformer layers. vLLM owns"
msgstr "序列并行（SP）将token维度在张量并行rank之间进行切分，并围绕Transformer层的通信边界进行。vLLM拥有"

msgid "## How to use"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid ""
"Automatically enabled when DP>1, TP>1 are set, and specific all2all backend with moe model.\n"
"The former FlashComm settings are removed."
msgstr ""
"当设置DP>1、TP>1，且使用特定的all2all后端与MoE模型时，自动启用。\n"
"原有的FlashComm设置已移除。"

msgid "Use the upstream SP configuration shown above instead."
msgstr "请改用上方所示的上游SP配置。"
